  "task_html": "<div class='task-block task-blue'><div class='task-block-label'>Wohin soll die Klassenfahrt gehen?</div><p style='font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 10px 0;'>Eure Klasse hat abgestimmt. Das Ergebnis seht ihr im <strong>Streifendiagramm</strong>: Der ganze Balken ist 100&nbsp;% (alle Stimmen), jeder Abschnitt ein Reiseziel. Lest die Prozentzahlen an der Skala unten ab.</p><svg viewBox='0 0 280 62' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' style='width:100%;max-width:300px;display:block;margin:8px auto;'><rect x='0' y='0' width='112' height='40' fill='#2563eb'/><rect x='112' y='0' width='98' height='40' fill='#d97706'/><rect x='210' y='0' width='70' height='40' fill='#6d28d9'/><line x1='0' y1='40' x2='0' y2='45' stroke='#6b7280' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='28' y1='40' x2='28' y2='45' stroke='#6b7280' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='56' y1='40' x2='56' y2='45' stroke='#6b7280' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='84' y1='40' x2='84' y2='45' stroke='#6b7280' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='112' y1='40' x2='112' y2='45' stroke='#6b7280' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='140' y1='40' x2='140' y2='45' stroke='#6b7280' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='168' y1='40' x2='168' y2='45' stroke='#6b7280' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='196' y1='40' x2='196' y2='45' stroke='#6b7280' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='224' y1='40' x2='224' y2='45' stroke='#6b7280' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='252' y1='40' x2='252' y2='45' stroke='#6b7280' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='280' y1='40' x2='280' y2='45' stroke='#6b7280' stroke-width='1'/><text x='0' y='58' text-anchor='start' font-size='11' fill='#6b7280'>0%</text><text x='140' y='58' text-anchor='middle' font-size='11' fill='#6b7280'>50%</text><text x='280' y='58' text-anchor='end' font-size='11' fill='#6b7280'>100%</text><rect x='0' y='0' width='280' height='40' fill='none' stroke='#1C1B1F' stroke-width='1.5'/></svg><p style='font-size:13px;line-height:2;margin:8px 0 0 0;'><span style='display:inline-block;width:11px;height:11px;background:#2563eb;border-radius:2px;margin-right:6px;'></span>Nordsee &nbsp;&nbsp;<span style='display:inline-block;width:11px;height:11px;background:#d97706;border-radius:2px;margin-right:6px;'></span>Berge &nbsp;&nbsp;<span style='display:inline-block;width:11px;height:11px;background:#6d28d9;border-radius:2px;margin-right:6px;'></span>Stadtfahrt</p></div><div class='task-block task-green' style='margin-top:12px;'><div class='task-block-label'>Aufgabe</div><div class='tbl-wrap'><table><thead><tr><th style='background:#2563eb;'>Nordsee (%)</th><th style='background:#d97706;'>Berge (%)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><input class='cell-input' data-ans='40' placeholder='?'></td><td><input class='cell-input' data-ans='35' placeholder='?'></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p style='font-size:14px;margin:12px 0 8px 0;'>In eurer Klasse sind 24 Kinder. Wie viele davon haben f&uuml;r <strong>Stadtfahrt</strong> gestimmt?</p><input class='cell-input' data-ans='6' placeholder='Wie viele Kinder?'></div><div class='task-block task-blue' style='margin-top:12px;'><div class='task-block-label'>Zweite Umfrage: Essen unterwegs</div><p style='font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 10px 0;'>Eine zweite Abstimmung zeigt, was sich die Klasse f&uuml;r unterwegs w&uuml;nscht &ndash; diesmal als <strong>Kreisdiagramm</strong>: Der ganze Kreis ist 100&nbsp;%.</p><svg viewBox='0 0 140 140' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' style='width:160px;display:block;margin:8px auto;'><path d='M 70 70 L 70.00 10.00 A 60 60 0 0 1 70.00 130.00 Z' fill='#2563eb'/><path d='M 70 70 L 70.00 130.00 A 60 60 0 0 1 12.94 51.46 Z' fill='#d97706'/><path d='M 70 70 L 12.94 51.46 A 60 60 0 0 1 70.00 10.00 Z' fill='#6d28d9'/><circle cx='70' cy='70' r='60' fill='none' stroke='#1C1B1F' stroke-width='1.5'/></svg><p style='font-size:13px;line-height:2;margin:8px 0 0 0;'><span style='display:inline-block;width:11px;height:11px;background:#2563eb;border-radius:2px;margin-right:6px;'></span>Pizza (H&auml;lfte) &nbsp;&nbsp;<span style='display:inline-block;width:11px;height:11px;background:#d97706;border-radius:2px;margin-right:6px;'></span>Wraps &nbsp;&nbsp;<span style='display:inline-block;width:11px;height:11px;background:#6d28d9;border-radius:2px;margin-right:6px;'></span>Obst</p></div><div class='task-block task-orange' style='margin-top:12px;'><div class='task-block-label'>Aufgabe</div><div class='tbl-wrap'><table><thead><tr><th style='background:#2563eb;'>Pizza (%)</th><th style='background:#6d28d9;'>Obst (%)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><input class='cell-input' data-ans='50' placeholder='?'></td><td><input class='cell-input' data-ans='20' placeholder='?'></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class='check-bar'><button class='btn-check' onclick='checkStation(11)'>&#x2713; &Uuml;berpr&uuml;fen</button><button class='btn-reset' onclick='resetStation(11)'>&#x21BA; Zur&uuml;cksetzen</button><span class='check-result' id='check-result-11'></span></div>",
  "sol_html": "<div style='font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;'>Nordsee: <strong>40&nbsp;%</strong> (0&nbsp;% bis 40&nbsp;%)<br>Berge: <strong>35&nbsp;%</strong> (40&nbsp;% bis 75&nbsp;%)<br>Stadtfahrt: 25&nbsp;% von 24 Kindern: 24&nbsp;:&nbsp;100 = 0,24 &middot; 25 = <strong>6 Kinder</strong><br><br>Pizza ist die H&auml;lfte des Kreises = <strong>50&nbsp;%</strong><br>Obst ist das kleinste St&uuml;ck = <strong>20&nbsp;%</strong></div>"
